Package: libva-v4l2
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Provides: va-driver
Description: VA-API backend for V4L2 stateful codecs (Qualcomm Iris, Arm Linlon)
 Hardware video decoding and H.264/HEVC encoding through the V4L2 stateful M2M
 interface. This experimental driver targets Qualcomm SC8280XP (Iris),
 including Radxa Dragon Q8B, and CIX CD8180/Sky1 (Arm Linlon "mvx" with a
 Panthor GPU), including Orange Pi 6 Plus. It requires a compatible kernel
 and firmware.
 .
 Includes the MSM and Panthor driver aliases and GStreamer VA environment
 configuration. FastCV video processing is disabled in distribution builds.
